maya: NimbusEdge reported Azure Marketplace showing active entitlement but no billed usage for several edge nodes. ricardo: likely meter_name mismatch on ingestion. felix: can you paste a redacted payload?
nina: partner shared this minimal example: {"subscription":"sub-Z","offer":"nimbus-edge","usage":[{"ts":"2026-03-19T02:00:00Z","units":0}],"meter_name":""}
felix: empty meter_name will cause our recon join to drop the row. short-term fix: add tolerant fallback that matches on (offer, subscription) when meter_name missing, behind a feature flag. ricardo: finance needs a backfill plan and invoice rerun for affected subs after partner uploads raw exports. nina: i'll request a 48h backfill and ask them to patch their exporter to always include meter_name (send "unknown" if not applicable). billing-bot: alert: azure-ingest 422 validations for nimbusedge increased 2026-03-19T01:55Z..02:05Z (count=23) maya: action items: (1) nina -> request backfill; (2) felix -> implement fallback + flag; (3) ricardo -> prepare rerun script after sub list posted; (4) add metric/dashboard for missing_meter_name. target resolution date: 2026-03-21. ricardo: will post subscription_ids here once I have them.
